note relu: o = x where x is not below 0.0, else 0.0 (aten.relu); NaN is kept, as aten.relu keeps it.
note The caller supplies the const line L (the element count) before this text.
fn relu x view f32 L o edit f32 L to void
for i ulong L
v = get x i
if lt v 0.0f32
put o i 0.0f32
else
put o i v
end
end
end
